                <p>Copy of certificate of registry, No. 80, of the schooner called the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Kate and Anna</hi>, 23 42/100 tons.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Issued at the port of <placeName>San
